# The morlock revision every retro artefact is built from — the wasm beside
# this file, the macOS binaries, the iOS c-archive and the gym binaries.
#
# morlock enters through a `replace` to a gitignored checkout at
# scripts/engines/morlock-src, so go.sum carries no line for it and nothing in
# the module graph records which source produced any of these. This file is
# that record, and scripts/sync-morlock.sh makes it load-bearing: every build
# checks the revision out rather than trusting whatever is on disk.
#
# To move it: edit the line below, run scripts/retro-wasm/build.sh (which
# rewrites BUILD.txt), and restage the native artefacts. CI fails if the pin
# and BUILD.txt disagree, so a bump without a rebuild cannot merge.
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored; the first remaining line is the rev.

